{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# New SoV basis tests: left and right swapped (gl(3), L=1, diagonal twist)\n\nSame set-up as `diagonalise-B-C-diagonal.wb` (adjoint $\\Lambda=\\{2,1,0\\}$, $G=\\mathrm{diag}(z_1,z_2,z_3)$, $\\nu$ factors on the fused transfer matrices), but with the roles of left and right swapped:\n\n- $\\langle\\bar x_A|$ — built on $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}|$ with the shifted $t^S$ at $\\theta+2h$ (the old $|y_A\\rangle$ recipe),\n- $|\\bar y_B\\rangle$ — built on $|\\mathrm{vacR}\\rangle$ with the unshifted $t$ at $\\theta$ (the old $\\langle x_B|$ recipe).\n\nThe vacua are for now generic global rotations of the highest- or lowest-weight state. Goal: $\\langle\\bar x_A|\\mathrm{vacR}\\rangle = 0$ unless $\\bar x_A = \\langle\\mathrm{vacL}|$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## gl(3) generators in the Gelfand–Tsetlin basis",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n  ps[rep] = \n   Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[\n          Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, \n            Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, \n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, \n     Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := \n  J0[k][pat] = \n   Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := \n  Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, \n         Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n         Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n       ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := \n  Jm[k][pat] = \n   Sum[Product[\n       pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n      Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n        Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n      ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := \n  JJ[k, l, rep] = \n   Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, \n    JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, \n    JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Representation, Lax matrix, diagonal twist",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\\[CapitalLambda], \\[Nu]];\n\\[CapitalLambda][1] = {2, 1, 0};\n\\[Nu][n_][u_] := \n  Product[(u - \\[Theta][l] - h \\[CapitalLambda][l][[n]]), {l, 1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\\[ScriptCapitalL], T, TG, TGS, Ee, EE];\nEe[\\[Alpha]_][i_, j_] := \n  Ee[\\[Alpha]][i, j] = JJ[i, j, \\[CapitalLambda][\\[Alpha]]];\nEE[i_, j_] := Ee[1][i, j];\n\\[ScriptCapitalL][\\[Alpha]_][i_, j_][u_] := \\[ScriptCapitalL][\\[Alpha]][i, j][u] = \n  u IdentityMatrix[dim[\\[CapitalLambda][\\[Alpha]]]] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h Ee[\\[Alpha]][j, i];\nG = DiagonalMatrix[{z[1], z[2], z[3]}];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = \\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, j][u - \\[Theta][1]];\n(* un-normalised: the \\[Nu] factors go on the fused transfer matrices instead *)\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := \n  TG[{i, j}][u] = \n   Sum[\\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, k][u - \\[Theta][1]] G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Quantum minors and fused transfer matrices",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[QM, tG, QMG];\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QM[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[\n      Permutations[\n        Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (T[#][\n           u + h - h Position[\n                Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // \n             Flatten // Last] & /@ \n         Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], \n     1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QMG[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[\n      Permutations[\n        Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TG[#][\n           u + h - h Position[\n                Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // \n             Flatten // Last] & /@ \n         Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], \n     1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntG[a_][u_] := \n  tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[tR, t, tS];\n(* un-normalised fused transfer matrices *)\ntR[{1, 0}][u_] := tR[{1, 0}][u] = tG[1][u] // Simplify;\ntR[{1, 1}][u_] := tR[{1, 1}][u] = tG[2][u] // Simplify;\ntR[{2, 0}][u_] := \n  tR[{2, 0}][u] = tG[1][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[2][u + h] // Simplify;\ntR[{2, 1}][u_] := \n  tR[{2, 1}][u] = tG[2][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] // Simplify;\ntR[{2, 2}][u_] := \n  tR[{2, 2}][u] = \n   tG[2][u] . tG[2][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] . tG[1][u] // Simplify;\n(* normalised by \\[Nu][1] *)\nt[{0, 0}][u_] := t[{0, 0}][u] = IdentityMatrix[8];\nt[{1, 0}][u_] := t[{1, 0}][u] = tR[{1, 0}][u]/\\[Nu][1][u];\nt[{1, 1}][u_] := t[{1, 1}][u] = tR[{1, 1}][u]/(\\[Nu][1][u] \\[Nu][1][u - h]);\nt[{2, 0}][u_] := t[{2, 0}][u] = tR[{2, 0}][u]/(\\[Nu][1][u] \\[Nu][1][u + h]);\nt[{2, 1}][u_] := t[{2, 1}][u] = tR[{2, 1}][u]/(\\[Nu][1][u] \\[Nu][1][u + h] \\[Nu][1][u - h]);\nt[{2, 2}][u_] := t[{2, 2}][u] = tR[{2, 2}][u];\n(* shifted, normalised by \\[Nu][3] with the opposite shifts *)\ntS[{1, 0}][u_] := tR[{1, 0}][u]/\\[Nu][3][u];\ntS[{1, 1}][u_] := tR[{1, 1}][u + h]/(\\[Nu][3][u] \\[Nu][3][u + h]);\ntS[{2, 0}][u_] := tR[{2, 0}][u - h]/(\\[Nu][3][u] \\[Nu][3][u - h]);\ntS[{2, 1}][u_] := (tG[2][u + h] . tG[1][u - h] - tG[3][u + h])/(\\[Nu][3][u] \\[Nu][3][u + h] \\[Nu][3][u - h]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Vacua: generic global rotations (to be fixed)\n\nThe first GT basis vector is the highest weight, the last the lowest. `hwQ` switches which one both vacua are rotations of; the angles $a_i$ (left) and $b_i$ (right) are free.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "hw = {{1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}}; lw = {{0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1}};\n(* only the generators that act nontrivially on each extremal state *)\nvacLof[True, {a1_, a2_, a3_}] := hw . MatrixExp[a1 Ee[1][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[a2 Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[a3 Ee[1][2, 3]];\nvacRof[True, {b1_, b2_, b3_}] := MatrixExp[b1 Ee[1][3, 2]] . MatrixExp[b2 Ee[1][3, 1]] . MatrixExp[b3 Ee[1][2, 1]] . Transpose[hw];\nvacLof[False, {a1_, a2_, a3_}] := lw . MatrixExp[a1 Ee[1][2, 1]] . MatrixExp[a2 Ee[1][3, 1]] . MatrixExp[a3 Ee[1][3, 2]];\nvacRof[False, {b1_, b2_, b3_}] := MatrixExp[b1 Ee[1][2, 3]] . MatrixExp[b2 Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[b3 Ee[1][1, 2]] . Transpose[lw];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "hwQ = False;\nvacL = vacLof[hwQ, {a1, a2, a3}];\nvacR = vacRof[hwQ, {b1, b2, b3}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Swapped SoV bases $\\langle\\bar x_A|$ and $|\\bar y_B\\rangle$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "gtpats = {{{1}, {0, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {0, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {2, 0}}, {{2}, {2, 1}}};\ngtpairs = Flatten[Table[{A1, A2}, {A1, gtpats}, {A2, gtpats}], 1];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* left states from the shifted tS at \\[Theta]+2h; vacuum label {{2},{2,1}} *)\nClearAll[xbar];\nxbar[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = vacL;\nxbar[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = vacL . tS[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . Inverse[tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h]] // Simplify;\nxbar[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = vacL . tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h];\nxbar[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = xbar[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h];\nxbar[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = xbar[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tS[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h];\nxbar[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = vacL . tS[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h];\nxbar[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = xbar[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tS[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h];\nxbar[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = xbar[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tS[{2, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* right states from the unshifted t at \\[Theta]; vacuum label {{1},{0,0}} *)\nClearAll[ybar];\nybar[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = vacR;\nybar[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = t[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . Inverse[t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]]] . vacR // Simplify;\nybar[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . vacR;\nybar[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = t[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1]] . vacR;\nybar[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . ybar[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\nybar[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = t[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1]] . ybar[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\nybar[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = t[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . ybar[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\nybar[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = t[{2, 1}][\\[Theta][1]] . ybar[{{2}, {0, 0}}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Condition on the vacua: $\\langle\\bar x_A|\\mathrm{vacR}\\rangle = 0$ for $A \\neq \\{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}\\}$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nonvac = DeleteCases[gtpats, {{2}, {2, 1}}];\nvacConds = Table[Factor[(xbar[A] . vacR)[[1, 1]]], {A, gtpats}];\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[{gtpats, vacConds}], {\"A\", \"\\[LeftAngleBracket]xbar_A|vacR\\[RightAngleBracket]\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"24\" data-out-n=\"365\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[365]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div data-wolfram-is-skeleton=\"1\" data-wolfram-atom-count=\"3077\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:12.747em;vertical-align:-6.1035em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.6435em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.6035em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.6035em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12.707em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.1035em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.6035em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.9135em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.4446em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0795em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.8744em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span cl