  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Original $x$, $y$ with lowest-weight vacua\n\nBack to the original recipe — $\\langle x_A|$ from the unshifted $t$ at $\\theta$ on $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}|$ (vacuum label $\\{\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\}\\}$), $|y_B\\rangle$ from $t^S$ at $\\theta+2h$ on $|\\mathrm{vacR}\\rangle$ (vacuum label $\\{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}\\}$) — but with the vacua rotations of the lowest-weight state, angles $c_i$ (left), $d_i$ (right).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* x_A, y_B on arbitrary vacua, so HW and LW choices can be compared side by side *)\nxOf[vL_] := Module[{x20 = vL . t[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . Inverse[t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]]] // Simplify},\n   <|{{1}, {0, 0}} -> vL, {{2}, {0, 0}} -> x20, {{1}, {1, 0}} -> vL . t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]], {{1}, {1, 1}} -> vL . t[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1]], {{2}, {1, 0}} -> x20 . t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]], {{2}, {1, 1}} -> x20 . t[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1]], {{2}, {2, 0}} -> x20 . t[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1]], {{2}, {2, 1}} -> x20 . t[{2, 1}][\\[Theta][1]]|>];\nyOf[vR_] := Module[{y20 = tS[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . Inverse[tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h]] . vR // Simplify},\n   <|{{2}, {2, 1}} -> vR, {{2}, {2, 0}} -> y20, {{2}, {1, 1}} -> tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . vR, {{2}, {1, 0}} -> tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y20, {{2}, {0, 0}} -> tS[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y20, {{1}, {1, 1}} -> tS[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . vR, {{1}, {1, 0}} -> tS[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y20, {{1}, {0, 0}} -> tS[{2, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y20|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* reference: which vacuum orthogonality does the original HW choice (rotparams) satisfy? *)\nrotparams = {p3 -> (p2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(p1 (z[2] - z[3])), r1 -> (p1 (z[2] - z[3]))/(p2 (z[1] - z[2])), r2 -> (z[2] - z[3])/(p2 z[1] - p2 z[2]), r3 -> (z[1] - z[3])/(p1 (-z[2] + z[3]))};\nvLhw = vacLof[True, {p1, p2, p3}] /. rotparams; vRhw = vacRof[True, {r1, r2, r3}] /. rotparams;\nxHW = xOf[vLhw]; yHW = yOf[vRhw];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{A, Simplify[(xHW[A] . vRhw)[[1, 1]]], Simplify[(vLhw . yHW[A])[[1, 1]]]}, {A, gtpats}], {\"A\", \"\\[LeftAngleBracket]x_A|vacR\\[RightAngleBracket]\", \"\\[LeftAngleBracket]vacL|y_A\\[RightAngleBracket]\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
