  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "The HW `rotparams` satisfy: $\\langle x_A|\\mathrm{vacR}\\rangle=0$ unless $A=\\{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}\\}$ (vacR's own label), and $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}|y_B\\rangle=0$ unless $B=\\{\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\}\\}$ (vacL's label). Impose the same on the LW vacua.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "vLlw = vacLof[False, {c1, c2, c3}]; vRlw = vacRof[False, {d1, d2, d3}];\nxLW = xOf[vLlw]; yLW = yOf[vRlw];\neqsLW = DeleteCases[Numerator /@ Together /@ Join[Table[(xLW[A] . vRlw)[[1, 1]], {A, DeleteCases[gtpats, {{2}, {2, 1}}]}], Table[(vLlw . yLW[A])[[1, 1]], {A, DeleteCases[gtpats, {{1}, {0, 0}}]}]], 0];\nsolLW = Solve[Thread[eqsLW == 0], {c1, c2, c3, d1, d2, d3}] // Simplify;\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{i, solLW[[i]], Simplify[(xLW[{{2}, {2, 1}}] . vRlw)[[1, 1]] /. solLW[[i]]]}, {i, Length[solLW]}], {\"branch\", \"angles\", \"\\[LeftAngleBracket]x_{(2),(2,1)}|vacR\\[RightAngleBracket]\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
